- Derive stacked resource and commodity segments from the same contribution records used by production totals.
- Preserve total bar heights in both Cards on roll and Expected production modes.
- Use established resource colours and related-resource colours with diagonal grey commodity hatching.
- Add focused calculation and UI regression coverage.

